{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43499","headline":"焚裘 · 无名氏","name":"焚裘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今主临前殿，惩奢爇异裘。\n忽看阳焰发，如覩吉光流。\n丽彩辞宸扆，余香在御楼。\n火随余烬灭，气逐远烟浮。\n素朴回风变，凋华逐志休。\n永垂恭俭德，千古揖皇猷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}